BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 258.70 Tm (still fail together, and that packets resuming at 0.18 seconds does not close the test when the application recovers at 1.4) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 243.47 Tm (seconds, the figure that governs acceptance [BqHUjrp6rGo @ 00:22:34]. Bench gear carries its own blind spots:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.25 Tm (ElectroHoard's TH2685 capacitor analyzer only goes to 200 volts, too low for 450 to 500 volt tube caps) Tj ET
